{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35881","headline":"依韵修睦上人山居十首 九 · 李咸用","name":"依韵修睦上人山居十首 九","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"太玄太易小窗明，古义寻来醉复醒。\n西伯纵逢头已白，步兵如在眼应青。\n寒猿断後云爲槛，宿鸟惊时月满庭。\n此景得闲闲去得，人间无事不曾经。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李咸用","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_35881.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35881","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}